# This directory is a replayable patch adapt set: the patches below are applied
# with `git apply` against a DSH checkout, so every file here must keep the same
# line endings on every machine and every fresh clone.
#
# The repository runs with `core.autocrlf=true`, which would rewrite these files
# to CRLF on checkout. Without this rule the markdown that documents the set
# drifts away from the LF-only patch files it describes, and a CRLF context line
# never matches an LF working tree (measured 2026-09-12: with CRLF the whole set
# failed 0/8 against its own baseline, with LF it applied 8/8).
*.patch text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
.gitattributes text eol=lf
